  "details": "If for any reason no controllers are currently available in VR mode (Either disconnected or whatever), there is no way for you to target and select menu items (Such as Calibrate) The Crosshair that exists in SteamVR and in Desktop Mode is gone so it is impossible to use your head to point at anything and use trigger to select items like you can in SteamVR Home and SteamVR Overlays. I think some basic input options such as those in Desktop  mode should be made available in VR mode if controllers are not detected or disappear as a fallback.",
